<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <%- include("../partials/head") %>
    <title>Order Summary</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/checkout.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <%-include("../partials/header") %>

    <section class="checkout-section">
      <div class="checkout-detail">
        <div class="delivery-address-div">
          <div class="da-title-change">
            <p id="delivery-address-titie">DELIVERY ADDRESS</p>
            <button id="add-change-address-button"></button>
          </div>
          <p id="delivery-address"></p>
        </div>

        <div class="ordered-product-div">
          <% let i = 0 %> <% for(const productData of products) { %> <% const
          product = productData.product %> <% for(const {productSize,quantity}
          of productData.productSizesAndQuantity) { %>
          <div
            id="item<%=i%>"
            class="ordered-product"
            data-product-id="<%= product._id %>"
            data-product-size="<%=productSize%>"
            data-product-quantity="<%=quantity%>"
          >
            <img
              class="ordered-product-img"
              src="<%= "/" + product.image.split("/").splice(2).join("/")%>"
              alt="<%=product.name%>"
            />
            <div class="ordered-product-detail">
              <p id="ordered-product-name"><%=product.name%></p>
              <p id="ordered-product-price">Rs. <%=product.rentPrice%>/day</p>
              <p id="ordered-product-size">
                Size: <span><%=productSize%></span>
              </p>
              
              <div class="quantity-remove-btn">
                <div class="quantity-btn" data-item-id="item<%=i%>">
                  <button class="q-minus quantity-toggle">-</button>
                  <p class="product-quantity"><%=quantity%></p>
                  <button class="q-plus quantity-toggle">+</button>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <% i++ %> <% } %> <% } %>
          </div>

          <div class="rent-instruction">
          <h2>Instructions</h2>
          <h3>How It Works</h3>
          <ol>
            <li>Place Your Order
              <p>Once you've selected the item you'd like to rent, simply choose your preferred size and rental duration, and place the order on our website.</p>
            </li>
            <li>Confirmation & Contact
              <p>After your order is placed, we will get in touch with you to confirm your details and finalize the rental process. Expect a call or email from our team to discuss your rental dates, delivery options, and any additional requirements such as Id proof.</p>
            </li>
            <li>Delivery
              <p>We will deliver the items to your preferred address on the agreed-upon date, ensuring that it arrives in perfect condition for your event or occasion.</p>
            </li>
            <li>Return the Item
              <p>Once you're done, simply return the item on or before the due date. We’ll provide return instructions to make the process easy and hassle-free.</p>
            </li>
            <li>Cleaning & Maintenance
              <p>No need to worry about cleaning – we’ll take care of it once the item is returned. Please ensure the item is in the same condition as it was delivered.</p>
            </li>  
          </ol>
          
          <h3>Rental Terms & Conditions:</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Rental Duration 
              <p>The rental period is specified on the product page. Late returns may incur additional charges.</p>
            </li>
            <li>Sizing
              <p>Please double-check the size details before placing your order. If you're unsure, feel free to contact us for assistance.</p>
            </li>
            <li>Damage Policy
              <p>If the item is returned damaged, we may charge additional fees for repairs or replacement.</p>
            </li>
            <li>Delivery & Return
              <p>You’ll receive a tracking number for the delivery, and we’ll provide instructions for returning the items.</p>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="checkout-continue-div">
          <p id="checkout-confirmation-email">
            Order confirmation email will be sent to
            <span id="user-email">......</span>
          </p>
          <button id="checkout-continue-btn">CONTINUE</button>
        </div>

        
      </div>

      <div class="checkout-price-detail">
        <P class="price-details">PRICE DETAILS</P>
        <div class="item-price-total">
          <div class="total">
            <p>Price(<span class="total-items">0</span> items)</p>
            <p class="total-amount">Rs.00</p>
            </div>
          <div class="dc">
            <p>Delivery Charges</p>
            <p class="delivery-charge">Rs...</p>
          </div>
          <div class="deposit">
            <p>Deposit Charges</p>
            <p class="deposit-charge">Rs...</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="total-amt">
          <p>Total Amount</p>
          <p class="net-amount">Rs. 00</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      </section>
    <%- include("../partials/footer") %>
    <script src="https://checkout.razorpay.com/v1/checkout.js"></script>
    <script src="/js/rentCheckout.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
